# Control File Multiplexing
  ---To create multiple copies of control files for database safety.

## Commands Used
-login as sys user

SHOW PARAMETER control_files;

SHUTDOWN IMMEDIATE;

-Create New Location(or use any existing path)
EX : mkdir -p /u02/oradata/THRONE

(copy original controlfile to new location)
cp /u01/app/oracle/oradata/THRONE/control01.ctl  /u02/oradata/THRONE/control02.ctl

STARTUP NOMOUNT;

ALTER SYSTEM SET control_files=
'/u01/app/oracle/oradata/THRONE/control01.ctl',
'/u02/oradata/THRONE/control02.ctl'
SCOPE=SPFILE;

SHUTDOWN IMMEDIATE;

STARTUP;

SHOW PARAMETER control_files;

STARTUP;
s
SHOW PARAMETER control_files;
